---

<Layout title="NAZILAH STORE — Distributor Top Up Game Termurah & Instan 24 Jam">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Hero Promo Banner (Inspired by Stitch Canvas) -->
    <div class="relative w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0f131c] via-[#181b25] to-[#10b981]/15 border border-[#262a34] p-6 sm:p-10 mb-10 shadow-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="max-w-xl z-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/15 border border-[#10b981]/30 text-[#4edea3] text-xs font-bold mb-4">
          <span>⚡</span>
          <span>SISTEM H2H AUTO-DISPATCH (1-3 DETIK)</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3">
          Top Up Game Favorit <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#4edea3] to-emerald-400">
            Tanpa Antre, Instan & Murah
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#94a3b8] mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Nikmati layanan top-up otomatis 24 jam dengan QRIS semua e-wallet & virtual account. Tanpa registrasi paksa, pesanan langsung masuk dalam hitungan detik.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="/order/mobile-legends"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#10b981] hover:bg-[#059669] text-white text-xs font-bold transition shadow-lg shadow-[#10b981]/25 flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Top Up Mobile Legends</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/kalkulator"
            class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#1c1f29] hover:bg-[#262a34] border border-[#3c4a42] text-xs font-semibold text-[#dfe2ef] transition"
          >
            Kalkulator WR MLBB
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-3 z-10">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0f131c]/90 border border-[#262a34] backdrop-blur-md text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#4edea3] font-mono-numbers">1.8s</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-[#94a3b8] mt-0.5">Rata-Rata Waktu Proses</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0f131c]/90 border border-[#262a34] backdrop-blur-md text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-400 font-mono-numbers">99.9%</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-[#94a3b8] mt-0.5">Tingkat Keberhasilan</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Background glow circles -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Flash Sale Section (React Island) -->
    <FlashSaleSection client:load items={flashSales} />

    <!-- Game Catalog Section (React Island) -->
    <GameCatalog client:load games={games} />

    <!-- Feature Value Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-[#1c1f29]">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#181b25] border border-[#262a34]">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#10b981]/10 text-[#4edea3] flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Pengiriman Otomatis</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#94a3b8]">Didukung server H2H langsung ke publisher, pesanan masuk 1-3 detik.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#181b25] border border-[#262a34]">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">
          💳
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">20+ Metode Bayar</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#94a3b8]">QRIS Nasional, Virtual Account BCA, BRI, Mandiri, dan E-Wallet.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#181b25] border border-[#262a34]">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">100% Legal & Aman</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#94a3b8]">Diamond dan item resmi dari jalur distribusi resmi tanpa risiko banned.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#181b25] border border-[#262a34]">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">
          💬
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Customer Care 24/7</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#94a3b8]">Tim bantuan kami selalu aktif di WhatsApp setiap saat Anda butuhkan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

